{"v":1,"src":"scribe+alignement","coverage":0.965,"lines":[{"text":"Intro]","t":1.94,"e":2.14,"w":[["Intro",1.94,2.14]],"ok":0.0},{"text":"Jaurès Amani.","t":2.24,"e":3.6,"w":[["Jaurès",2.24,2.82],["Amani",2.86,3.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Aujourd'hui, c'est ton jour.","t":6.2,"e":7.6,"w":[["Aujourd'hui",6.2,6.66],["c'est",6.74,6.88],["ton",6.94,7.12],["jour",7.18,7.6]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Tes collègues sont réunis pour célébrer l'homme de valeur que tu es.","t":8.94,"e":14.1,"w":[["Tes",8.94,9.08],["collègues",9.14,9.52],["sont",9.6,9.74],["réunis",9.78,10.24],["pour",10.34,10.5],["célébrer",10.58,11.3],["l'homme",12.1,12.32],["de",12.38,12.54],["valeur",12.62,13.02],["que",13.1,13.36],["tu",13.46,13.64],["es",13.7,14.1]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Bonne fête, champion.","t":16.12,"e":18.02,"w":[["Bonne",16.12,16.34],["fête",16.44,16.84],["champion",17.38,18.02]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Mokolo ya lelo, ezali fete ya solo","t":33.16,"e":38.22,"w":[["Mokolo",33.16,33.72],["ya",33.76,33.96],["lelo",34,34.46],["ezali",36.3,36.86],["fete",36.98,37.32],["ya",37.32,37.42],["solo",37.52,38.22]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Na biro mpe na misala, to silisi kokoma solo","t":39.86,"e":45.22,"w":[["Na",39.86,40],["biro",40.06,40.42],["mpe",40.5,40.68],["na",40.74,40.9],["misala",40.94,41.74],["to",42.14,42.34],["silisi",42.54,43.18],["kokoma",43.86,44.58],["solo",44.72,45.22]],"ok":0.89},{"text":"Le jour est arrivé, c’est ton anniversaire","t":47.46,"e":53.68,"w":[["Le",47.46,47.62],["jour",47.7,47.92],["est",47.96,48.16],["arrivé",48.2,48.98],["c’est",51,51.2],["ton",51.28,51.48],["anniversaire",51.54,53.68]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"To kotisi esengo, le ciel est notre repère.","t":54.62,"e":59.62,"w":[["To",54.62,54.98],["kotisi",55.06,55.46],["esengo",55.56,56.24],["le",57.78,57.88],["ciel",58.02,58.28],["est",58.32,58.42],["notre",58.5,58.8],["repère",58.96,59.62]],"ok":1.0},{"text":"Joyeux anniversaire, Jaurès Amani !","t":59.98,"e":62.9,"w":[["Joyeux",59.98,60.46],["anniversaire",60.5,61.56],["Jaurès",61